Here is the structured goal model based on the mission description:

### Goals

| Goal ID | Name                  | Text                                                                                     | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Target Condition/Enquired Information | Relation |
|---------|-----------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------|-----------|----------------------------------------|-----------|
| G1      | Fulfill Request       | Ensure resources are collected and delivered to the specified location.              | -                 | Achieve  | Mission completed successfully.         | -         |
| G1.1    | Collection Phase      | Collect required resources from storage locations.                                    | -                 | Perform   | Resources collected.                     | AND       |
| G1.2    | Delivery Phase        | Deliver collected resources to the specified location.                                | -                 | Perform   | Resources delivered.                     | AND       |
| G2      | Resource Allocation   | Assign robots to collect resources from different storages.                          | #                 | Perform   | Resources assigned.                      | OR        |

### Tasks

| Task ID | Name                  | Text                                                                                     | Relation | Location                  | Number of Robots |
|---------|-----------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-----------|---------------------------|------------------|
| AT1     | Identify Storage      | Locate storage locations for requested resources.                                     | AND       | Hospital storage          | 1                |
| AT2     | Plan Collection Route | Determine optimal path for collection.                                                 | AND       | Hospital storage          | 1                |
| AT3     | Request Resources     | Send message to storage for resource retrieval.                                        | AND       | Hospital storage          | 1                |
| AT4     | Confirm Delivery      | Verify resources are ready for delivery.                                               | AND       | Delivery location         | 1                |
| AT5     | Plan Delivery Route   | Determine optimal path for delivery.                                                   | AND       | Delivery location         | 1                |
| AT6     | Deliver Resources     | Transport resources to the specified location.                                          | AND       | Delivery location         | 1                |

### Relationships

- **G1 -> G1.1, G1.2 [AND]**: Both collection and delivery must be completed.
- **G1.1 -> G1.1.1, G1.1.2, G1.1.3 [AND; #]**: Tasks are executed sequentially but in parallel.
- **G1.1.3 -> AT3 [AND]**: Leaf task for requesting resources.
- **G1.2 -> G1.2.1, G1.2.2 [AND]**: Sequential delivery tasks.
- **G2 -> AT1, AT2, AT3 [OR]**: Multiple robots can handle tasks independently.

This model ensures efficient resource management with fallback mechanisms for battery issues, using AND/OR decompositions and parallel execution where beneficial.
